# Environment & Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.staging
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Logs
**/logs/
*.log

# Uploads
**/uploads/

# Build output
**/dist/
**/build/

# Frontend source maps (production)
**/*.js.map

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db